/* ===================================================================
   lingo-content.mjs
   -------------------------------------------------------------------
   Every Learn the Lingo term, and all of its copy. tools/build-lingo.mjs
   turns this into learn-the-lingo/<slug>.html and rewrites the A-Z index
   on learn-the-lingo.html. Nothing in the builder needs editing to change
   a word of the copy.

   `generated: false` means the builder indexes the term but does not
   write its page. apr.html was hand-written first and is proven live, so
   it keeps its file and contributes only its index and related-card
   metadata. Everything else is generated.

   ACCURACY. Every figure in here was checked against the body that
   publishes it before it was written down - CFPB, Regulation Z and DD,
   the Federal Reserve H.15/G.19, FRED, IRS. Rates and published figures
   go stale: when one is updated, update the `sources` entry and the
   `reviewed` date on the same edit.
   =================================================================== */

