   "<li>Size the account first with the <a href=\"../emergency-fund-calculator.html\">emergency fund calculator</a>, then go find it a yield.</li>",
   "<li>Read <a href=\"../blog/how-to-save-your-first-1000.html\">how to save your first $1,000</a>, which is the part APY cannot do for you.</li>",
   "<li>If banks have turned you down before, start with <a href=\"../blog/second-chance-bank-accounts.html\">second-chance bank accounts</a> and <a href=\"../blog/chexsystems-explained.html\">ChexSystems explained</a>.</li>",
   "<li>Work through <a href=\"../stage-2-stabilize.html\">Stage 2 &middot; Stabilize</a>, where the savings habit gets built, or browse every definition in <a href=\"../learn-the-lingo.html\">Learn the Lingo</a>.</li>"
