   "<li>Electronic Code of Federal Regulations, <a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-12/chapter-X/part-1026/subpart-E/section-1026.32\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">12 CFR &sect; 1026.32(b)</a> &mdash; definition of a bona fide discount point and the conditions for excluding points from the points-and-fees cap.</li>",
