   "<li>Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis (FRED), <a href=\"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/MORTGAGE30US\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">30-Year Fixed Rate Mortgage Average in the United States (MORTGAGE30US)</a> &mdash; 6.69% for the week ending 6 August 2026, the base rate in every example above. Source: Freddie Mac Primary Mortgage Market Survey.</li>",
