  "h1span": "",
  "heroSub": "The number a landlord, a lender and an insurer see before they see anything else about you &mdash; what it is actually measuring, and what the law says you can do about it.",
  "aka": "credit rating &middot; FICO Score &middot; VantageScore &middot; the score",
