   "<li>Fair Isaac Corporation, <a href=\"https://www.ficoscore.com/faqs-about-fico-scores-us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FAQs About FICO Scores in the US</a>, and VantageScore Solutions, <a href=\"https://vantagescore.com/consumers/consumer-faqs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Consumer FAQs</a> (the bands from Poor to Exceptional; both models using a 300 to 850 range).</li>",
