   "<li>Credit Repair Organizations Act, <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/1679b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">15 U.S.C. &sect; 1679b</a>, via Cornell Legal Information Institute (the ban on untrue or misleading statements about creditworthiness, and the prohibition on charging before a service is fully performed).</li>",
