  "metaDesc": "Inflation is a sustained rise in the general price level. How CPI and PCE are built, why they disagree, and how to turn a nominal return into a real one.",
  "ogTitle": "Inflation &mdash; Learn the Lingo",
  "ogDesc": "A sustained rise in the general price level &mdash; how it is measured, why two official U.S. measures disagree, and what it does to every number you are quoted.",
  "eyebrow": "Inflation",
  "h1": "Inflation",
  "h1span": "",
  "heroSub": "A sustained rise in the general price level &mdash; which is the same sentence as a sustained fall in what a dollar buys. Here is how the United States measures it, and why two official measures of the same month disagree.",
