  "ogTitle": "Private Mortgage Insurance (PMI) &mdash; Learn the Lingo",
  "ogDesc": "You're told PMI is money thrown away. It's the price of not waiting five more years to buy &mdash; and on a conventional loan, federal law ends it three specific ways. Here are all three, with dates.",
  "eyebrow": "Housing",
