   "<li>Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System, G.19 Consumer Credit, via <a href=\"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/TERMCBCCINTNS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Commercial Bank Interest Rate on Credit Card Plans, Accounts Assessed Interest</a> &mdash; 22.15% for May 2026, the rate used in the borrowing comparison.</li>",
