   "<b>Report changes no later than 10 days after the end of the month</b> in which they happened (<a href=\"https://www.ssa.gov/ssi/text-report-ussi.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SSA</a>). An overpayment notice can be appealed within 60 days, and recovery can be waived on Form SSA-632."
