  "heroSub": "Three lines on a chart: an average, and a channel that widens when price gets choppy. The man who built them has published a numbered rule saying a touch of the outer line is not a signal &mdash; and another saying not to trust the statistics in his own formula.",
  "aka": "BB &middot; Bollinger Band &middot; Bollinger&rsquo;s bands &middot; volatility bands &middot; the bands",
