  "ogTitle": "Moving Average Convergence Divergence (MACD) &mdash; Learn the Lingo",
  "ogDesc": "The intimidating name hides one subtraction. Gerald Appel built it around 1977, the histogram is not volume, and no published source explains where 12, 26 and 9 came from.",
