  "metaDesc": "Annual dividends per share divided by the share price. Why a yield rises when the price falls, the four dates that decide who gets paid, and how it is taxed.",
  "ogTitle": "Dividend Yield &mdash; Learn the Lingo",
  "ogDesc": "A yield that just turned attractive is often a stock the market just marked down &mdash; because the price is the denominator. What the number promises, and what it doesn't.",
