   "<li>S&amp;P Dow Jones Indices, <a href=\"https://www.spglobal.com/spdji/en/documents/methodologies/methodology-sp-us-indices.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S&amp;P U.S. Indices Methodology</a> (float-adjusted market capitalization weighting, the Investable Weight Factor and the 0.1 minimum for S&amp;P Composite 1500 eligibility, &ldquo;constituent selection is at the discretion of the Index Committee,&rdquo; the reserved right to make exceptions, quarterly share and float updates, the third-Friday quarterly rebalancing effective dates, and the 500 constituents of the S&amp;P 500).</li>",
   "<li>FTSE Russell, <a href=\"https://www.lseg.com/en/ftse-russell/russell-reconstitution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Russell Reconstitution</a> (the Russell US Indexes reconstitution &ldquo;changing from an annual to a semi-annual schedule in 2026,&rdquo; the 2026 rank day of Thursday 30 April, and the rebuilt indexes taking effect after the U.S. market close on 26 June).</li>",
