   "It exists because a share price alone is meaningless. Nothing about $8 a share is cheap and nothing about $800 a share is expensive until you know what the business earns behind each share. P/E converts a price into a common unit that can be set beside another company, another year, or a bond yield. That is a real service, and the whole difficulty is that one of the two inputs is a hard fact and the other one is not."
