  "ogTitle": "Wage Garnishment &mdash; Learn the Lingo",
  "ogDesc": "The check is short, payroll says call the court, and nobody explains the rules. Federal law says a creditor gets the lesser of two numbers &mdash; and one of them is not the number at the bottom of your pay stub.",
